== [    BASIC ] ============================================================================================
   MNEMONIC: vcvtbiasps2hf8 [ENC: EVEX, MAP: MAP5, OPC: 0x38]
     LENGTH:  7
        SSZ: 64
       EOSZ: 32
       EASZ: 64
   CATEGORY: CONVERT
    ISA-SET: AVX10_V2_AUX_512
    ISA-EXT: AVX512EVEX
 EXCEPTIONS: E4
 ATTRIBUTES: HAS_MODRM HAS_EVEX ACCEPTS_SEGMENT 
  OPTIMIZED: 62 F5 6C 5B 38 48 01 

== [ OPERANDS ] ============================================================================================
##       TYPE  VISIBILITY  ACTION      ENCODING   SIZE  NELEM  ELEMSZ  ELEMTYPE                        VALUE
--  ---------  ----------  ------  ------------   ----  -----  ------  --------  ---------------------------
 0   REGISTER    EXPLICIT     RCW     MODRM_REG    128     16       8   HFLOAT8                         xmm1
 1   REGISTER    EXPLICIT       R          MASK     64     64       1       INT                           k3
 2   REGISTER    EXPLICIT       R        NDSNDD    512     16      32   FLOAT32                         zmm2
 3     MEMORY    EXPLICIT       R      MODRM_RM     32      1      32   FLOAT32  TYPE  =                 MEM
                                                                                 SEG   =                  ds
                                                                                 BASE  =                 rax
                                                                                 INDEX =                none
                                                                                 SCALE =                   0
                                                                                 DISP  =  0x0000000000000004
--  ---------  ----------  ------  ------------   ----  -----  ------  --------  ---------------------------

== [      AVX ] ============================================================================================
  VECTORLEN: 512
  BROADCAST: 1_TO_16
   ROUNDING: NONE
        SAE: N
       MASK: k3 [MERGING]

== [      ATT ] ============================================================================================
   ABSOLUTE: vcvtbiasps2hf8 0x04(%rax) {1to16}, %zmm2, %xmm1 {%k3}
   RELATIVE: vcvtbiasps2hf8 0x04(%rax) {1to16}, %zmm2, %xmm1 {%k3}

== [    INTEL ] ============================================================================================
   ABSOLUTE: vcvtbiasps2hf8 xmm1 {k3}, zmm2, dword ptr ds:[rax+0x04] {1to16}
   RELATIVE: vcvtbiasps2hf8 xmm1 {k3}, zmm2, dword ptr ds:[rax+0x04] {1to16}

== [ SEGMENTS ] ============================================================================================
62 F5 6C 5B 38 48 01 
:           :  :  :..DISP
:           :  :..MODRM
:           :..OPCODE
:..EVEX
